				<article class="hand-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
					<h2 class="font-heading" style="color: var(--fg-pencil); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">The Magic of Wedding Date Numerology</h2>
					
					<img src="/images/pocket-watch-sketch.webp" alt="Wedding Date Numerology — Marriage Destiny & Life-Path Calculator" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width: 100%; max-width: 500px; display: block; margin: 2rem auto; border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 8px;" />
					
