							<summary class="font-heading" style="cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.1rem; outline: none; list-style: none;">Can we change our wedding date if the numbers don't match?</summary>
							<p class="font-body" style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Absolutely! If you're exploring different options and want a date that resonates perfectly with both of your Life Path numbers, you can run as many dates through our calculator as you like. Finding the right wedding date numerology is a fun way to intentionalize your planning process without any stress.</p>
